==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|important}}, from {{der|en|la-med|importāns|important-, importāns}}. {{surf|en|import<t:to be important>|-ant}}.

Displaced native {{noncog|ang|hēah}} and {{m|ang|hefiġ}}.

